OL,3,GNEWSAEx-Met officer from Couzens unit
OL,4,Aguilty of rape
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former Metropolitan Police officer
OL,7,Fwho served in the same command as Wayne
OL,8,FCouzens has been found guilty of raping
OL,9,Fa woman.
OL,11,FMark Tyrell, 57, was convicted at
OL,12,FSouthwark Crown Court of one count of
OL,13,Frape, three of sexual assault and one
OL,14,Fof perverting the course of justice by
OL,15,Ftrying to delete messages he had sent
OL,16,Fher.
OL,18,FJurors heard he had sex with the woman,
OL,19,Fwho cannot be identified for legal
OL,20,Freasons, after she repeatedly said no,
OL,21,Fthen asked her: "Do you realise that
OL,22,Fwhat I've just done, that was rape?"
